          "quote": "(net (code \"24\") (name \"/PWM1_C2\") (node (ref \"C6\") (pin \"2\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "R9–R12 | 0 Ω (jumpers) | Select which M5Stack bus pin (pin 19/21 for ch.1, pin 20/22 for ch.2) supplies PWM1/PWM2"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Short R10, R10 for Core2 and CoreS3 / Short R9, R11 for others"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "C6 blocks the DC connection needed for the PWM1 route to bus pin 21, so the specified Core2/CoreS3 channel-1 mapping will not work as intended. Its large capacitance also couples signal transitions between the two GPIO nets.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "An anomaly is present: C6 is a 100u capacitor where the specified PWM1 alternate-pin mapping requires a 0 Ω jumper, and the expected R10 is absent."
}

